  "description": "A comprehensive .NET 10 shared utility library for ASP.NET Core projects. Provides a Dapper-based generic repository pattern for SQL Server, MySQL, and PostgreSQL; a functional Result<T> error-handling type; pagination DTOs; JWT authentication helpers; ICurrentUserService; ICacheService with in-memory and Redis backends; IEmailService via MailKit SMTP; IFileStorageService for local disk storage; Correlation ID and request/response logging middleware; EF Core audit interceptor and soft-delete global query filter; health checks; FluentMigrator integration; EnumHelper; and a rich set of UniversalOperations extension methods.",
  "id": "awisk.Common",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-05-12T16:25:04.213Z",
