  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v3.0.0 — Upgraded to .NET 10. Added ICurrentUserService, ICacheService (memory + Redis), IEmailService (MailKit SMTP), IFileStorageService, CorrelationIdMiddleware, RequestResponseLoggingMiddleware, EF Core AuditInterceptor, soft-delete global query filter, health check extensions, CancellationToken propagation across all async repository methods, and Result<T> Map/Bind/Match operators. See full changelog: https://github.com/SyedAliHassanShahBukhari/awisk.common/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
